@startuml
' drevops/behat-steps - data flow for building, checking and publishing the
' documentation site.
' Traced from docs/package.json, docs/docusaurus.config.js, docs/sidebars.js,
' docs/src/remark/repositoryLinks.js, docs/src/theme/,
' docs/src/components/ScrollableTable/, docs/cspell.json,
' docs/playwright.config.js, docs/tests/accessibility/,
' .github/workflows/test.yml, .github/workflows/release-docs.yml.
' Regenerate every SVG with:  plantuml -tsvg docs/content/architecture/*.puml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
title Data flow: building and publishing the documentation site

participant "Docs job or\nRelease docs" as CI
participant "docusaurus build" as Build
participant "repositoryLinks()" as Links
participant "docs/build/" as Out
participant "npm test\nnpm run test:accessibility" as Checks
participant "Netlify or\nGitHub Pages" as Host

CI -> Build: npm run build, with repository links at\nRELEASE_VERSION, else DOCS_REF, else main
activate Build
Build -> Build: read every page under docs/content/,\n.md as CommonMark, the sidebar\nfrom the folder tree
note right of Build
  docs.php writes into 3 of the pages:
  steps.md and helpers.md below their title,
  and the option and tag tables of
  guides/configuration.md.
end note

loop every page
  Build -> Links: the page's Markdown tree, before\nDocusaurus resolves its links
  activate Links
  Links -> Links: resolve each relative link\nagainst the page's directory
  alt the target is under docs/content/
    Links --> Build: unchanged, for Docusaurus to resolve
  else the repository holds the target
    Links --> Build: a GitHub blob or tree URL at the ref
  else it names no file in the repository
    Links -> Build: throw, naming the link and the page
    Build --> CI: the build fails
  end
  deactivate Links
end

Build -> Build: bundle the theme with the overrides in\ndocs/src/theme/ for tables, Gherkin\nhighlighting, the mobile menu and\nthe search box
Build -> Build: check every page link and anchor,\nand throw on a broken one
Build -> Out: the static site and its search index
deactivate Build

opt Docs job
  CI -> Checks: after the build
  activate Checks
  Checks -> Checks: Jest unit tests, then CSpell over\nevery page under docs/content/ except\nsteps.md and helpers.md, plus\ndocs/README.md and the root README.md
  Checks -> Out: serve it with docusaurus serve
  Checks -> Checks: axe on every page against WCAG A and AA,\nin light and dark, at desktop and phone width,\nthen the search box and the mobile menu
  Checks --> CI: pass, or fail the job
  deactivate Checks
end

alt Docs job, with the Netlify secrets set
  CI -> Host: deploy docs/build/ to Netlify: the development\nsite on a push to main, a preview otherwise
else Release docs, on a tag push or a manual run
  CI -> Host: deploy docs/build/ to GitHub Pages,\nbuilt from the tag or branch it checked out
end
@enduml
